<td id="A5.T2.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_bb">AdamW <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citep">(<a href="#bib.bib14" title="" class="ltx_ref">Loshchilov and Hutter, 2019</a>)</cite></td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>
